                 60: *
                 61: *  ERB:  (Error Block)  Data Structure Definition.
                 62: *
                 63: 
  0000           64:          ORG      0
0000 0002        65: ERB:NEXT rmb 2    W/ Address of next error block in chain.
0002 0002        66: ERB:FPGE rmb 2    W/ Form # of error.
0004 0002        67: ERB:LINEN         rmb 2             W/ Line # of error.
                 68: 
  0006           69: ERB:SIZE:         equ *             K/ length of an error block.




