0933 29ED        92:          BVS      DOSK1               B/ NOPE.  MARK AS SKIPPED, GET ANOTHER LINE.
                 93:          ;JMP     0,X               YES:  GO TO HANDLER.
0935 6E00        94:          JMP      0,X
