09A2 26FA       182:          BNE      DOSK1A              B/ THIS ELSE IS MEANINGLESS
                183: *  THIS ELSE MIGHT TERMINATE THE SKIP
09A4 968E       184:          LDAA     SKPFLG            ARE WE SKIPPING TO AN ELSE?
09A6 2DF6       185:          BLT      DOSK1A              B/ NO, ONLY A FIN WILL STOP US.
                186:          ;DEC      SKPFLG            IS THIS THE 'ELSE' WE WANT?
09A8 7A008E     187:          DEC      SKPFLG
09AB 2EF1       188:          BGT      DOSK1A              B/ NO, GOT SOME MORE TO SKIP.
                189: *  THIS ELSE WILL STOP US.  WE MAY HAVE TO DO SOME WORK IF
