ASM/6800 1.3H4: 09DE ASM/6800 1.4       - - -   D E C O D E   L I N E   - - -
08/16/82 00:00:00; Page 59; Form 1      - - -   D O I T L   - - -
ASM14A.DITL0.ASM
                  3: *9*
                  4: *
                  5: *  DOITL--
                  6: *
                  7: *        DECODES COMMAND AND FIGGERS OUT WHAT TO DO W/ IT.
                  8: *
                  9: *        (1)      IF CF(1) IS 3 OR 4 CH, AND IF FIRST 3 ARE A
                 10: *                 VALID OP, THEN WE SCAN AN OPCODE.
                 11: *
                 12: *        (2)      IF NOT (1) THEN IF CF(1) IS A SYMBOL ONLY,
                 13: *                 AND IF THAT SYMBOL IS IN THE PSUEDO-OP TABLE,
                 14: *                 (USER OR ASSEMBLER) THEN WE SCAN A DIRECTIVE.
                 15: *
                 16: *        (3)      IF (1) NOR (2) THEN CF IS HANDLED AS A FUNNY
                 17: *                 DATA EXP.
                 18: *
                 19: *        AFTERWARDS, LIST IS CALLED.
                 20: *
                 21: *
  09E0           22: DOITDR9  ;JMP     DOITDR
09E0 7E0AA0      23:          JMP      DOITDR
  09E3           24: DOITEX9  ;JMP      DOITEX
09E3 7E0B08      25:          JMP      DOITEX
  09E6           26: DOITL    EQU      *
                 27:          ;LDX      CFPTR
09E6 DE24        28:          LDX      CFPTR
09E8 DF26        29:          STX      AFPTR             PREPARE TO LOOK FOR AF.
                 30:          ;JSR      CHCFSYM           IS CF(1) A SYMBOL??
09EA BD2057      31:          JSR      CHCFSYM
09ED 26F4        32:          BNE      DOITEX9           B/ NO==> GO TREAT AS FUNNY DATA STAT
                 33:          ;CMPB    #',               CK/ IS TERMINATOR A COMMA? (B SET BY CHCFSYM)
09EF C12C        34:          CMPB     #',
09F1 27F0        35:          BEQ      DOITEX9             B/ YUP.  CAN'T BE OPCODE.
09F3 86FF        36:          LDAA     #$FF              SET FLAG:  NO REGISTER SEEN.
09F5 9756        37:          STAA     REG
09F7 D662        38:          LDAB     SYM               GET LENGTH OF SYMBOL,
09F9 54          39:          LSRB                       IF SYM WAS ORIGINALLY ...
09FA 07          40:          TPA                        ...3 OR 4 CHARACTERS LONG, THEN...
09FB C9FE        41:          ADCB     #-2               ...RESULT IS ZERO.
09FD 26E1        42:          BNE      DOITDR9           B/ NOT AN OPCODE.




ASM/6800 1.3H4: 09FD ASM/6800 1.4       - - -   D E C O D E   L I N E   - - -
08/16/82 00:00:00; Page 60; Form 1      - - -   D O I T L   - - -
