                 41: *
                 42: * NOW GO DO APPROPRIATE GROUP
0A6C 36          43: DOOCGO   PSHA                       SAVE REG A
                 44:          ;JSR      LFPC              SET LF TO HERE;
0A6D BD21DB      45:          JSR      LFPC
0A70 32          46:          PULA
                 47:          ;JSR      ISIT              WHAT GROUP...
0A71 BD08DE      48:          JSR      ISIT
0A74 FDFF0203    49:          FCB      T:DRNI,T:DYDR,T:DYDX,T:BRA,T:JMP,T:DXNI,0
0A7B 2605        50:          BNE      DOOCG1            B/ DONT FIND AF
                 51:          ;JSR      FINDAF
0A7D BD206C      52:          JSR      FINDAF
0A80 9658        53:          LDAA     GRP               GET GROUP CODE
  0A82           54: DOOCG1   EQU      *
0A82 16          55:          TAB      GET VALUE IN SAFE PLACE...
0A83 C0FD        56:          SUBB     #T:BASE                MAKE INDEX FROM 0 TO N
                 57:          ;JSR      TBJMP             DO TABLE JUMP
0A85 BD1DEF      58:          JSR      TBJMP
0A88 0B61        59:          FDB      BTBL
                 60: * COME HERE IF REGISTER IS NOT FOUND
  0A8A           61: DOOC2    ;LDX      CFPTR
0A8A DE24        62:          LDX      CFPTR
0A8C DF26        63:          STX      AFPTR
0A8E 9658        64:          LDAA     GRP               GET GROUP CODE
0A90 2CDA        65:          BGE      DOOCGO            B/ OK NOT TO HAVE REGISTER
                 66:          ;JSR     ILLCF             ELSE =>USER IS TWIT<=
0A92 BD089F      67:          JSR      ILLCF
0A95 4F          68:          CLRA                         AND TREAT AS REGISTER A.
0A96 20D4        69:          BRA      DOOCGO              (NOTE THAT AFPTR HAS ALREADY BEEN RESET.)
                 70: *




