ASM/6800 1.3H4: 0B05 ASM/6800 1.4       - - -   D E C O D E   L I N E   - - -
08/16/82 00:00:00; Page 68; Form 2      - - -  D O I T D R  - - -
ASM14A.DREX.ASM
                  2: *
                  3: *
                  4: *  D O I T M M
                  5: *
                  6: *        Does Micro expansions
                  7: *
                  8: *
                  9: *        
  0B08           10: DOITMM
  0001           11:          IFUND    MC6809
                 12: *        JMP      DOITEX
  0002           13:          ELSE
 *S*             14:          ;JSR     LFPC              Set LF to value of PC
 *S*             15:          JSR      LFPC
 *S*             16:          ;JSR     CHCFSYM           Rescan command field
 *S*             17:          JSR      CHCFSYM
 *S*             18:          ;LDX     #MICMAC           Head of Micro/Macro table
 *S*             19:          LDX      #MICMAC
 *S*             20:          ;JSR     FSYM1             Scan table for symbol
 *S*             21:          JSR      FSYM1
 *S*             22:          BNE      DOITEX            B/Not found
 *S*             23:          STX      OPPTR
 *S*             24:          LDAB     MM:FLAG,X         
 *S*             25: 
 *S*             26: DOITMICRO
 *S*             27:          STAB     VAL               Save # of micro bytes
 *S*             28:          ;LDX     MM:PTR,X          Load byte sequence pointer
 *S*             29:          LDX      MM:PTR,X
 *S*             30: DOITMICROL
 *S*             31:          LDAA     0,X
 *S*             32:          INX
 *S*             33:          STX      OPPTR             Pointer into micro sequence
 *S*             34:          ;JSR     PUTB              Output it
 *S*             35:          JSR      PUTB
 *S*             36:          ;LDX     OPPTR
 *S*             37:          LDX      OPPTR
 *S*             38:          ;DEC     VAL               DONE?
 *S*             39:          DEC      VAL
 *S*             40:          BNE      DOITMICROL        B/No
 *S*             41:          ;JMP     LIST




