0B63 0C53        21:          FDB      PSHPUL            GROUP-2      MONADIC IN A OR B
0B65 0B7F        22:          FDB      DYADR             GROUP-1      DYADIC IN (A OR B) AND MEMORY.
0B67 0C27        23:          FDB      MONAD             GROUP 0      MONADIC IN A, B, OR MEMORY.
0B69 0C31        24:          FDB      NILAD             GROUP 1      NILADIC.
