ASM14A.DITL0.ASM
                 42: *
0BA5 8DCC        43: DYADRNI  BSR      DYADRSCN          SET UP REGISTER IN OPCODE.
                 44: 
  0BA7           45: DYADXNI  EQU      *                 ENTER HERE FOR STX, ETC.
0BA7 8D17        46: DYADR4   BSR      CHINDX            INDEXED INSTRUCTION?
0BA9 8D68        47:          BSR      CHDIR             NO:  DIRECT?
                 48: *
