0C79 8200        24:          SBCA     #0
0C7B 2710        25:          BEQ      BRANP             CHECK VAL FOR IN RANGE...
0C7D 2D0A        26:          BLT      BRANN             B/ VAL<0
  0C7F           27: BRANE    ;JSR      BRANERR           *E* OUT OF RANGE BRANCH
