ASM14A.FCONV.ASM
1018 0001        17: DPFLAG   RMB      1                 Decimal point count for FCONVI
1019 0001        18: DPCOUNT  RMB      1                 Decimal place count for FCONVI
101A 0001        19: EXPOVF   RMB      1                 Exponent overflow flag
101B 0001        20: CTNB     RMB      1                 Holds carry (0..199) to next byte
101C 0002        21: FACX     RMB      2                 Holds pointer to floating ACC
101E 0002        22: FCVIRT   RMB      2                 Return address for floating conversion
1020 0002        23: LOOPX    RMB      2                 2 byte loop counter




ASM/6800 1.3H4: 1020 ASM/6800 1.4       - - - D I R E C T I V E   P R O C E S S I N G - - -
08/16/82 00:00:00; Page 100; Form 1     - - - FORM FLOATING CONSTANT - - -
ASM14A.FCONV.ASM
                 25: *        FLOATING INPUT CONVERSION ROUTINES
                 26: *        A,B CONTAIN MAX # OF CHARS TO EAT (INCLUDING BLANKS)
                 27: *        X REG CONTAINS POINTER TO CHARACTER STRING TO CONVERT
                 28: *        RESULT IS CONVERTED TO FLOATING POINT FORMAT AND OUTPUT TO BO
                 29: *        DOES NOT EAT THE CR OR ANY OTHER DELIMITER
                 30: *        ROUTINE WILL EAT STRINGS OF THE FOLLOWING FORMAT:
                 31: *        <0 OR MORE BLANKS> FOLLOWED BY
                 32: *        <'+' OR '-' OR NOTHING> FOLLOWED BY
                 33: *        <1 OR MORE DIGITS WHICH MAY CONTAIN A '.' ANYWHERE IN THIS FIELD
                 34: *        FIELD MAY CONTAIN UP TO 10 SIGNIFICANT DIGITS
                 35: *        (LEADING ZEROES ARE NOT CONSIDERED SIGNIFICANT
                 36: *        EXAMPLE:
                 37: *        0.000000103456789
                 38: *        THE "0.000000" PART IS NOT CONSIDERED SIGNIFICANT,
                 39: *        WHILE THE "103456789" PART IS CONSIDERED SIGNIFICANT)
                 40: *        MAY NOT BE > 127 NON-SIG ZEROS RIGHT OF DP & PRECEEDING SIG DIGITS
                 41: *        EXCESS SIGNIFICANT DIGITS ARE READ AND IGNORED> FOLLOWED BY
                 42: *        <'e', 'E' OR NOT A 'E'> (DONE IF NOT 'E', ELSE...) FOLLOWED BY
                 43: *        <'+' OR '-' OR NOTHING> FOLLOWED BY
                 44: *        <UP TO 3 DIGITS NOT TO EXCEED 126> FOLLOWED BY
                 45: *        <NOT A DIGIT>
                 46: *
                 47: *        JSR      FCONVI
                 48: *        BRA      ALL OK
                 49: *        BRA      OVERFLOW
                 50: *        BRA      SYNTAX ERROR
                 51: *
1022 8D68        52: FCONVI31 BSR      GETCHAR
1024 8D4B        53: LEFTDIG  BSR      ISDIG
