137E 965F        37:          LDAA     VAL               CHECK FOR IN RANGE.
1380 270A        38:          BEQ      FCB1              B/ ITS GOOD.
1382 43          39:          COMA                       CHECK FOR $FF (LEADING SIGN)
1383 2604        40:          BNE      FCB2              B/ NO WAY ITS GOOD.
