198F DEA3        19:          LDX      INCLHEAD
1991 DF50        20: PRTLNS0  STX      SORTAIL           SAVE IN HANDY (UNUSED) PLACE.
1993 2724        21:          BEQ      PRTLNS%             B/ LAST INCLUDE BLOCK PROCESSED.
