ASM14A.MAIN.ASM
                  2: *
                  3: * P1INIT
                  4: *        DOES ALL INITIALIZATION FOR BEGINNING OF ASSEMBLY.  CLEARS ALL
                  5: *        OF PAGE ZERO TO ZERO, CLEARS ALL OF THE DATA AREA (DATBEG TO 
                  6: *        DATEND) TO ZERO. GETS AND OF MEMORY AND STORES IT IN STPTR.
                  7: *        OTHER INITIAL VALUES FOR PAGE
                  8: *        ZERO ARE COPIED IN FROM THE TABLE PZ1I: THROUGH PZ1E:.  THESE VALUES
                  9: *        ARE TRANSFERRED TO THE RANGE PZ1I THROUGH PZ1E.  THE BINARY BUFFER POINTER
                 10: *        IS THEN INITIALIZED SEPARATELY (FOR REASONS THAT ARE PURELY HISTORICAL); 
                 11: *        WE THEN CALL GETOPT TO READ OPTIONS FROM THE USER.
                 12: *
  1A57           13: P1INIT   ;LDX     #PZBASE
1A57 CE0020      14:          LDX      #PZBASE
  1A5A           15: P1I1     ;CLR     0,X               ZERO $0 --> $FF
1A5A 6F00        16:          CLR      0,X
1A5C 08          17:          INX
1A5D 8C00C5      18:          CPX      #PZEND
1A60 26F8        19:          BNE      P1I1
                 20: *
                 21:          ;LDX     #DATBEG           ZERO DATA AREAS
1A62 CE2F21      22:          LDX      #DATBEG
  1A65           23: P1I2     ;CLR     0,X
1A65 6F00        24:          CLR      0,X
1A67 08          25:          INX
1A68 8C329D      26:          CPX      #DATEND
1A6B 26F8        27:          BNE      P1I2
                 28: *
                 29:          ;LDX     IOPKGBASE         LOAD FIRST UNUSABLE LOCATION
1A6D DEFC        30:          LDX      IOPKGBASE
                 31: *
1A6F 09          32:          DEX
1A70 DFAC        33:          STX      STPTR             TBL GROWS DOWN!!!
                 34: *
                 35: *  COPY IN INITIAL VALUES.
                 36: *
                 37:          ;LDX     #PZ1I
1A72 CE00AE      38:          LDX      #PZ1I
1A75 DF34        39:          STX      TPTR
                 40:          ;LDX     #PZ1I:
1A77 CE1ABC      41:          LDX      #PZ1I:




