1AB1 5D          78: P1I6     TSTB                       GOT A DEPTH?
1AB2 2702        79:          BEQ      P1I7              B/NO
1AB4 D7B3        80:          STAB     DEPTH             YES - UPDATE
  1AB6           81: P1I7     EQU      *




