  0001            2:          DO       CONDASM=1
                  3: *
                  4: * CPRAB:  COMPARES OA TO OB, RETURNS A,B CLEARED, AND RETURNS
                  5: *   X AS PROPER INDEX INTO STACK.
  1CC7            6: CPRAB    EQU      *
1CC7 30           7:          TSX                        GET THE STACK POINTER,
1CC8 08           8:          INX
1CC9 08           9:          INX                        (GET RID OF RETURN ADDR.)
1CCA A604        10:          LDAA     OAL,X
1CCC A001        11:          SUBA     OBL,X
1CCE 07          12:          TPA                        GET CC
1CCF 16          13:          TAB                        SAVE CC
1CD0 06          14:          TAP                        RESTORE CC
1CD1 A603        15:          LDAA     OAH,X
1CD3 A200        16:          SBCA     OBH,X
1CD5 07          17:          TPA                        SAVE CC,
1CD6 2605        18:          BNE      CPRAB1            B/ IF HIGH BYTE NOT ZERO, THEN
                 19: *                                   CC ARE OK.
1CD8 84FB        20:          ANDA     #$FB              ELSE SCRUB Z FROM HIGH CC
1CDA C404        21:          ANDB     #$04              RETAIN Z FROM LOW CC
1CDC 1B          22:          ABA                        MERGE FOR NEW CC,
1CDD 5F          23: CPRAB1   CLRB                       GET A ZERO,
1CDE 06          24:          TAP                        SET CC,
1CDF 37          25:          PSHB                       GET A ZERO IN X W/O ....
1CE0 32          26:          PULA                       ...ZAPPING THE CC.
1CE1 39          27:          RTS
                 28:          FIN




