1D1A 8D6D         6:          BSR      MULTPLY           GO DO MULTIPLY,
1D1C 9631         7: XMUL1    LDAA     MLC+1             GET L(RESULT)
1D1E D630         8:          LDAB     MLC               GET H(RESULT)
