ASM/6800 1.3H4: 22A5 ASM/6800 1.4       - - - I / O    S E C T I O N - - -
08/16/82 00:00:00; Page 268; Form 4     - - - S V E R L - - -
ASM14A.IOFM.ASM
  0001            2:          IF       ERRLINES=1
                  3: *
                  4: *        SVERL:
                  5: *        SAVE ERROR LINE(S)
                  6: *        CONSTRUCTS ERROR-LINE LIST FOR PASS 2
                  7: *        ERROR LIST BLOCKS HAVE THE FOLLOWING FORM:
                  8: *        (X)  -->  0,1    NEXT; 0--> LAST
                  9: *          2,3    FPGE OF ERROR
                 10: *          4,5    LINE OF ERROR
                 11: *
  22A7           12: SVERL    EQU      *
22A7 9654        13:          LDAA     PASS              IS THIS PASS ONE ?
22A9 2722        14:          BEQ      SVERLR            B/ PASS ONE, DON'T KEEP ERRORS!
22AB 96BA        15:          LDAA     OPTF              IS THIS STUFF GOING TO GO ANYWHERE?
22AD 8580        16:          BITA     #OPT:EL           WELL?
22AF 271C        17:          BEQ      SVERLR            IF NOT, RETURN
                 18:          ;LDX     .CURINCLB         GET ADDRESS OF ERROR CHAIN
22B1 DEA7        19:          LDX      .CURINCLB
  0002           20:          rpt      INCLB:ERRCHN      Add appropriate value;
22B3 08          21:          INX
22B5 DF34        22:          STX      TPTR              SAVE CHAIN SCAN POINTER
  22B7           23: SVERL0   ;LDX     TPTR
22B7 DE34        24:          LDX      TPTR
                 25:          ;LDX     ERB:NEXT,X        FOLLOW LINK TO NEXT ERROR BLK
22B9 EE00        26:          LDX      ERB:NEXT,X
22BB 2711        27:          BEQ      SVERL1            B/ FOUND END
22BD DF34        28:          STX      TPTR              SAVE NEW ERROR BLOCK ADDRESS
                 29:          ;LDX     ERB:FPGE,X        IS THIS RIGHT PLACE FOR ERROR ?
22BF EE02        30:          LDX      ERB:FPGE,X
22C1 9C8F        31:          CPX      FPGE              ( = PROPER FPGE ?)
22C3 26F2        32:          BNE      SVERL0            NO, KEEP LOOKING
                 33:          ;LDX     TPTR              YES, GET BLOCK ADDRESS AGAIN
22C5 DE34        34:          LDX      TPTR
                 35:          ;LDX     ERB:LINEN,X       RIGHT LINE NUMBER ?
22C7 EE04        36:          LDX      ERB:LINEN,X
22C9 9C91        37:          CPX      LINEN
22CB 26EA        38:          BNE      SVERL0            B/ NO, KEEP LOOKING
22CD 39          39: SVERLR   RTS                        RETURN IF ALREADY AN ENTRY
                 40: *
22CE C606        41: SVERL1   LDAB     #ERB:SIZE:        GET 6 BYTES




ASM/6800 1.3H4: 22CE ASM/6800 1.4       - - - I / O    S E C T I O N - - -
08/16/82 00:00:00; Page 269; Form 4     - - - S V E R L - - -
