ASM14A.IOFM.ASM
                  2:    
                  3: *
                  4: *
                  5: *   P N C E O F
                  6: *
                  7: *        Punches last buffer, S9, 30 nulls, and turns off
                  8: *        punch.
                  9: *
  278A           10: PNCEOF   EQU      *
278A D6BA        11:          LDAB     OPTF              GET OPTION FLAGS:
278C C504        12:          BITB     #OPT:BO           BO REQUESTED?
278E 2732        13:          BEQ      PNCER             B/ NO:  RETURN.
2790 8DCE        14:          BSR      PNCHIT
                 15: 
2792 7D308C      16:          TST      CURREC+R$VALID    Have we output a record to the file?
2795 2603        17:          BNE      PNCEOF1             B/ Yes; no problem.
                 18:          ;JSR     PutRecordHdr      Otherwise, make room for the record hdr,
2797 BD2872      19:          JSR      PutRecordHdr
  279A           20: PNCEOF1  equ      *                   ...then output a zero-length LOADGO.
279A 8601        21:          LDAA     #1                Set argument: this is the last record;
                 22:          ;JSR     FinishCurrec        go write its header.
279C BD2913      23:          JSR      FinishCurrec
279F C603        24:          LDAB     #BO               Position the binary file to...
                 25:          ;JSR     REWANY              ...its beginning.
27A1 BD2A07      26:          JSR      REWANY
