27A4 B618FC      29:          LDAA     SADDR             Load up the start address (high)
27A7 F618FD      30:          LDAB     SADDR+1             (low)
27AA 37          31:          PSHB                       Save it (twice) on the stack.
27AB 36          32:          PSHA                            ...
27AC 37          33:          PSHB                            ...
27AD 36          34:          PSHA                            ...
27AE 8601        35:          LDAA     #RTYPE$START      Load type byte,
27B0 36          36:          PSHA                         put it at head of start record.
27B1 30          37:          TSX                        Load pointer to record into X,
