ASM/6800 1.3H4: 2971 ASM/6800 1.4       - - - I / O    S E C T I O N - - -
08/16/82 00:00:00; Page 317; Form 25    - - - F i l e   P o s i t i o n - - -
ASM14A.IOFM.ASM
                188: 
                189: *****>>>>>> FilePosition is falling in from previous page <<<<<<*****
                190: 
                191: 
                192: 
                193: *****************************************************************************
                194: *
                195: * Name:  SubFilebase (Offset (*in AB*), Pointer (*in X*))
                196: *
                197: * Function:
                198: *        This routine subtracts a specified 16-bit unsigned integer from
                199: *        a 32-bit integer in memory, updating the 32-bit integer in place.
                200: *
                201: * Arguments:
                202: *        X        "Pointer"         Address of byte 0 of the integer to be
                203: *                                     modified.
                204: *
                205: *        AB       "Offset"          16-bit, unsigned positive value to be
                206: *                                     subtracted from the integer at X.
                207: *
                208: * Changed:                          Preserved:
                209: *        A, B, C                         X
                210: *
                211: *****************************************************************************
                212: 
                213: **** Subtract 16 bit quantity in AB from 32-bit value @ (0..3,X)
  2974          214: SubFilebase       equ *
2974 43         215:          COMA
2975 53         216:          COMB
2976 0D         217:          SEC
2977 E903       218:          ADCB     3,X
2979 A902       219:          ADCA     2,X
297B E703       220:          STAB     3,X
297D A702       221:          STAA     2,X
297F 86FF       222:          LDAA     #$FF
2981 A901       223:          ADCA     1,X
2983 A701       224:          STAA     1,X
2985 86FF       225:          LDAA     #$FF
2987 A900       226:          ADCA     0,X
2989 A700       227:          STAA     0,X




