                  9:          ;PULX
2A3F 30          10:          TSX
2A40 EE00        11:          LDX      0,X
2A42 31          12:          INS
2A43 31          13:          INS
2A44 A600        14:          LDAA     0,X               NULL STRING IS NOT OK.
2A46 8DC9        15: PUTT1    BSR      PUTCC
2A48 08          16:          INX
2A49 A600        17:          LDAA     0,X               GET NEXT
2A4B 26F9        18:          BNE      PUTT1
                 19:          ;JMP      1,X
2A4D 6E01        20:          JMP      1,X




