                 45:          ;JSR     GETNAME           GO GET A NAME
2AB3 BD2B39      46:          JSR      GETNAME
2AB6 27E6        47:          BEQ      RSI               IF NULL - ASK AGAIN
2AB8 C601        48:          LDAB     #SI               LOAD CH#
2ABA 36          49:          PSHA                       <<SAVE SIZE>>
                 50:          ;JSR     OPEN$             OPEN THE SI CHANNEL
2ABB BD0108      51:          JSR      OPEN$
                 52: 
