                  2: *
                  3: * MOVEB
                  4: *
                  5: * MOVE STRING PTD TO BY TPTR1 TO STRING PTD TO BY TPTR.
                  6: *        STRING ENDS WHEN NULL SEEN.
                  7: *
                  8: * MOVEB1
                  9: *
                 10: * MOVE STRING POINTED TO BY (X) TO STRING POINTED TO BY TPTR.
                 11: *
2C0D 08          12: MOVEB0   INX                        BUMP DESTINATION POINTER,
2C0E DF34        13:          STX      TPTR                AND SAVE.
                 14: *
  2C10           15: MOVEB    ;LDX     TPTR1             LOAD PTR
2C10 DE36        16:          LDX      TPTR1
2C12 A600        17: MOVEB1   LDAA     0,X               LD CHAR
2C14 08          18:          INX
2C15 DF36        19:          STX      TPTR1
                 20:          ;LDX     TPTR
2C17 DE34        21:          LDX      TPTR
2C19 A700        22:          STAA     0,X               SAVE CHAR
2C1B 4D          23:          TSTA                       A NULL?
2C1C 26EF        24:          BNE      MOVEB0            KEEP ON MOVING
2C1E 39          25:          RTS




