2C21 43          17:          COMA
2C22 8542        18:          BITA     #OPT:LO!OPT:DMP   ARE BOTH ON?
2C24 261C        19:          BNE      DUMPEX            IF NOT, DON'T BOTHER
                 20:          ;JSR     DUMPNAME          DUMP LIST SORTED BY NAME
